{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"お久しぶりです(^^)/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"無事帰還!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かえってきましたひめたんです♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここ数日、普通にふっつうに女子高生してましたー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"名古屋全握おやすみしたり、まともに日記書けなかったり、ほんとごめんね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"で、お仕事には行けないわ、みんなに会えないわ、高校のお勉強難しいわで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"死んじゃうんじゃないかと思った(*>ω<*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ただいまー♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"てかこのテスト週間中にいろんなこと起きすぎじゃろ!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"勝手に振り返ってみるね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"-金環日食-"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んね。一生に一度の金環日食だったらしいじゃん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんたちの学校は「勉強なんてしてる場合じゃない!」って言って"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一時間目カットになったの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だからばっちり観察しましたーよ＼(^O^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもねー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょうど太陽と月とが重なった時、曇った...よね?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"東京だけかな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「重なったー!」って日食グラスかけたら、なんにも見えないの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもだからって肉眼であんま見ちゃだめなんよね(`・・')"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あの時、日本中のみんなと同じ空を見てたんだよー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って考えたら素敵だよね。うん素敵!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆーわけで、みなさんの日食エピソード募集。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"-乃木坂46×広島-"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・乃木どこ?広島放送開始!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まじです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"半年間越しに叶った夢。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しいな(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱり番組やってるやってないって大きなポイントだと思うのね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それに、広島のみなさんにも乃木坂のこと知ってほしいし。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから本当ほんっと嬉しいの。広島ホームテレビさんありがとうございます!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"広島のみなさーん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしていつも乃木どこを楽しみにしてくださる"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさーん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎週日曜0:00〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"テレ東系にて放送!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"広島代表として、ひめたんもっともっと出演できるように頑張りますー♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂のみんなのこと大好きになってほしいな(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぜひチェックしてみてくださいね!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・6月9日、乃木坂46"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"広島にお邪魔します!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いや、乃木坂的に言ったらお邪魔するんだけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんは久々の広島だーよ＼(^O^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、ちょっと迷ったけどやっぱり決めました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"選抜入るまでは広島帰らんって宣言したけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回のイベントは広島のみなさんに乃木坂を知ってもらえる素敵な機会じゃん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆーわけで、乃木坂46として立派にイベントしたあとで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたん家にも友達ん家にも寄らずに帰ることにしたー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いわゆる「プライベートでは帰りません」的なーね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あんれー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分で言っててあれだけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今かっこいいこと言った!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・ストリーミングラジオ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回のおいシャン発売記念「おいでストリーミングラジオ」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ご好評につき、第二弾することになりまーした拍手!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回のぺあは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ろってぃ(河村真洋chan)×ひめたん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ろってぃよろしくね(^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんお楽しみねー♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/26/5974911/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「ひめたん大図鑑」を編集するだけでも大変だったでしょう?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"パソコンと携帯を駆使して頑張りまーした(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大変だったけど、ひめたんのこと知っていただけたんならそれでよーしっ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/26/5974911/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんはテスト終わったら何したい??"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とりあえず寝たいー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と思ったので、帰ってから速攻寝たのよ(^ω^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んー頑張った!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"テスト週間中は不規則すぎてびっくりするよ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"18時に寝て20時に起きて、それから3時に寝て4時に起きるの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いやー壮絶。これで成績が伴わないから切ない話だよねー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/26/5974911/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめた〜んハートマークいっぱい使わないほうがいい?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"むしろいっぱい使ってほしいー(*/ω＼*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はーとまーく。好きだよ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/26/5974911/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたん大図鑑13の写真の男装してるのは誰〜??"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んーななせまるーっ!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ななせまる(西野七瀬chan)お誕生日おめでとう(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"18才て。おっとなーだね♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも何かあったら、いや何もなくても"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぎゅーってしてくるななせまる可愛いよー大好きよ!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからもよろしくねっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/26/5974911/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/26/5974911/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今度コメントに俺の大図鑑でも書こうか?(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ということで、ひめたんもみなさんの大図鑑を作ってみたいの(^ω^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから毎回アンケートとりまーす♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よかったら答えてね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日のしつもん!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたん見たことありまーすか?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1.握手会・イベントでみた"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2.テレビ・ラジオでみた"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3.街中でみた"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4.夢の中でみた(・ω・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"5.みたことねーよーはーと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"6.そのた"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(*´・ω・*)ひめたん"}],"source":"archive"}